{"text":{"en":{"링크 볼·필로볼·L볼 | [회사명] 베어링":"Link Ball · Pillow Ball · L-Ball | [Company Name] Bearing","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Link Ball · L-Ball</p> <h2>링크 볼·L볼</h2> <p>볼 스터드와 소켓형 시트가 결합된 구면 조인트로, 직선·요동 운동이 함께 발생하는 링크 기구의 연결부에 사용됩니다. 제조사·형번 체계가 서로 다른 두 계열 — <strong>링크 볼</strong>(ZBL/RBL·RBI, 당사 SWS 카탈로그)과 <strong>L볼</strong>(LHSA·LHS·PRC, 당사 IKO 카탈로그) — 을 용도가 같아 한 페이지에서 함께 비교할 수 있도록 모았습니다.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Link Ball · L-Ball</p> <h2>Link Balls · L-Balls</h2> <p>A spherical joint combining a ball stud with a socket-type seat, used at the connecting points of link mechanisms where linear and oscillating motion occur together. Two series with different manufacturers and model-number systems — <strong>Link Ball</strong> (ZBL/RBL·RBI, our SWS catalog) and <strong>L-Ball</strong> (LHSA·LHS·PRC, our IKO catalog) — are gathered on this single page for easy side-by-side comparison, since they serve the same purpose.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">You can search by entering just part of the model number or dimensions.</p>","<button type=\"button\" class=\"cat-tab-btn active\" data-tab=\"link\">링크 볼 (ZBL/RBL·RBI)</button> <button type=\"button\" class=\"cat-tab-btn\" data-tab=\"lball\">L볼</button>":"<button type=\"button\" class=\"cat-tab-btn active\" data-tab=\"link\">Link Ball (ZBL/RBL·RBI)</button> <button type=\"button\" class=\"cat-tab-btn\" data-tab=\"lball\">L-Ball</button>","ZBL(RBL) 시리즈":"ZBL(RBL) Series","국내 유통 시장에서는 ZBL(잘만정공/JMC)과 RBL(일성테크/IBC) 두 형번이 동일 규격으로 상호 호환됩니다.":"In the domestic distribution market, the two model numbers ZBL (Jalman Jeonggong/JMC) and RBL (Ilsung Tech/IBC) are mutually interchangeable under the same spec.","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">구조 단면도 (개념도)</p> <svg viewbox=\"0 0 360 220\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 320px; width: 100%; height: auto;\" aria-label=\"링크 볼 단면도\"> <path d=\"M110,30 h140 a30,30 0 0 1 30,30 v40 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 v-40 a30,30 0 0 1 10,-30 z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"></path> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"42\" fill=\"#e7e7e4\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#333\"></circle> <rect x=\"168\" y=\"142\" width=\"24\" height=\"52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"158\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"166\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"166\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"174\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"182\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"182\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,4,2,4\"></line> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"30\"></line><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"150\"></line> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"150\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"></line> </g> <text x=\"30\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\" transform=\"rotate(-90 30 94)\">L (전장)</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"25\"></line><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"25\"></line> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"20\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"></line> </g> <text x=\"180\" y=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">D (하우징 외경)</text> <text x=\"220\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">나사부</text> <defs> <marker id=\"lbArrow\" markerwidth=\"6\" markerheight=\"6\" refx=\"3\" refy=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"></path> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 볼 스터드 + 소켓 하우징 구조 · D(하우징 외경)·L(전장)·볼 지름·나사(Thread)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">실제 형번별 비례와는 다를 수 있는 구조 개념도이며, 치수값은 아래 표를 따릅니다.</span></p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">Structural Cross-Section (Conceptual Diagram)</p> <svg viewbox=\"0 0 360 220\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 320px; width: 100%; height: auto;\" aria-label=\"Link Ball Cross-Section Diagram\"> <path d=\"M110,30 h140 a30,30 0 0 1 30,30 v40 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 v-40 a30,30 0 0 1 10,-30 z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"></path> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"42\" fill=\"#e7e7e4\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#333\"></circle> <rect x=\"168\" y=\"142\" width=\"24\" height=\"52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"158\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"166\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"166\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"174\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"182\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"182\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,4,2,4\"></line> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"30\"></line><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"150\"></line> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"150\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"></line> </g> <text x=\"30\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\" transform=\"rotate(-90 30 94)\">L (Overall Length)</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"25\"></line><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"25\"></line> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"20\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"></line> </g> <text x=\"180\" y=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">D (Housing O.D.)</text> <text x=\"220\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">Thread</text> <defs> <marker id=\"lbArrow\" markerwidth=\"6\" markerheight=\"6\" refx=\"3\" refy=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"></path> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ Ball stud + socket housing structure · D (Housing O.D.) · L (Overall length) · Ball Diameter · Thread<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">This is a conceptual structural diagram that may differ in proportion from actual model numbers; refer to the table below for dimension values.</span></p>","<label for=\"lbFilter\">형번 검색</label> <input id=\"lbFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: ZBL10 또는 M12\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"lbFilter\">Model No. Search</label> <input id=\"lbFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. ZBL10 or M12\" autocomplete=\"off\">","나사(Thread)":"Thread","D(하우징 외경)":"D (Housing O.D.)","볼 지름":"Ball Diameter","단위: mm (중량은 g)":"Unit: mm (Weight in g)","RBI 시리즈":"RBI Series","ZBL(RBL)과 달리 양쪽 모두 축 방향으로 나사가 나오는 구조로, 당사 SWS 카탈로그에는 “수주 대응품”(주문 제작)으로 별도 수록되어 있습니다.":"Unlike the ZBL(RBL), this design has threads protruding axially on both ends; it is listed separately in our SWS catalog as a “made-to-order item” (custom production).","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">당사 SWS 카탈로그 규격 도면</p> <img src=\"img/rbi_link_ball.png\" alt=\"RBI 구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">S·S1=나사 · L=전장 · D=하우징 외경 · W=폭</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">Our SWS Catalog Spec Drawing</p> <img src=\"img/rbi_link_ball.png\" alt=\"RBI Structure Cross-Section Diagram\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">S·S1=Thread · L=Overall Length · D=Housing O.D. · W=Width</p>","<label for=\"rbiFilter\">형번 검색</label> <input id=\"rbiFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: RBI10 또는 M12\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"rbiFilter\">Model No. Search</label> <input id=\"rbiFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. RBI10 or M12\" autocomplete=\"off\">","※ ZBL(RBL) 규격은 당사 SWS 카탈로그의 로드 엔드 페이지에 “ZBL(RBL)”로 함께 수록되어 있으며, 국내 유통 자료(잘만정밀 등)와도 동일 규격입니다. “R/L”은 나사 방향(우·좌)을 나타내며 형번 끝에 별도 표기됩니다. RBI 규격 역시 같은 카탈로그 페이지에 “수주 대응품”으로 함께 수록되어 있으나, 주문 제작 품목인 만큼 리드타임·최소 수량은 발주 전 견적 문의로 확인하시기 바랍니다. 일부 유통 자료에서 유사 형번을 다른 제조사(예: THK) 제품으로 표기하는 경우가 있으니, 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 형번과 도면을 대조해 최종 확인하시기 바랍니다.":"※ The ZBL(RBL) spec is listed together as “ZBL(RBL)” on the Rod End page of our SWS catalog, and matches the same spec found in domestic distribution materials (Jalman Jeongmil, etc.). “R/L” indicates the thread direction (right/left) and is marked separately at the end of the model number. The RBI spec is likewise listed on the same catalog page as a “made-to-order item,” but since it is a custom-production item, please confirm lead time and minimum order quantity via a quote inquiry before ordering. Some distribution materials list similar model numbers as products of other manufacturers (e.g., THK), so before precision machining or ordering, please always cross-check the model number and drawing for a final confirmation.","볼 스터드와 교차되는 축심을 가진 자동 조심형 미끄럼 베어링입니다. 그리스 봉입형(LHSA), 무급유식(LHS), 그리고 LHS용 더스트 커버(PRC)로 구성됩니다. 자동차·건설기계·농업용 기계 등의 링크 기구에 사용됩니다.":"A self-aligning plain bearing whose axis intersects the ball stud. It comes in a grease-packed type (LHSA), an oilless type (LHS), and a dust cover for the LHS (PRC). Used in link mechanisms for automobiles, construction machinery, agricultural machinery, and more.","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">당사 IKO 카탈로그 규격 도면 · L볼의 구조</p> <img src=\"img/l_ball_structure.png\" alt=\"L볼 LHSA·LHS 구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; width: 100%; max-width: 950px; height: auto; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">볼 스터드 · 본체 · 부시(저탄소강 또는 동합금) · 더스트 커버(LHSA 5 이상)</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">Our IKO Catalog Spec Drawing · L-Ball Structure</p> <img src=\"img/l_ball_structure.png\" alt=\"L-Ball LHSA/LHS Structure Cross-Section Diagram\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; width: 100%; max-width: 950px; height: auto; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">Ball Stud · Body · Bushing (Low-Carbon Steel or Copper Alloy) · Dust Cover (LHSA 5 and above)</p>","<label for=\"lballFilter\">형번 / 규격 검색</label> <input id=\"lballFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: LHSA10 또는 LHS20\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"lballFilter\">Model No. / Spec Search</label> <input id=\"lballFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. LHSA10 or LHS20\" autocomplete=\"off\">","<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"lballCount\" style=\"margin:0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"lballToggleAll\">전체 펼치기</button>":"<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"lballCount\" style=\"margin:0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"lballToggleAll\">Expand all</button>","LHSA 시리즈 · 리튬계면활성그리스 봉입형<span class=\"series-count\">8건</span>":"LHSA Series · Lithium Surfactant Grease-Packed Type<span class=\"series-count\">8 items</span>","나사 S":"Thread S","볼직경 mm":"Ball Diameter mm","LHS 시리즈 · 무급유식(자체 윤활이 필요)<span class=\"series-count\">10건</span>":"LHS Series · Oilless Type (Self-Lubricating)<span class=\"series-count\">10 items</span>","PRC · L볼용 더스트 커버(LHS용)<span class=\"series-count\">10건</span>":"PRC · Dust Cover for L-Ball (for LHS)<span class=\"series-count\">10 items</span>"},"ja":{"링크 볼·필로볼·L볼 | [회사명] 베어링":"リンクボール・ピロボール・Lボール | [会社名] ベアリング","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Link Ball · L-Ball</p> <h2>링크 볼·L볼</h2> <p>볼 스터드와 소켓형 시트가 결합된 구면 조인트로, 직선·요동 운동이 함께 발생하는 링크 기구의 연결부에 사용됩니다. 제조사·형번 체계가 서로 다른 두 계열 — <strong>링크 볼</strong>(ZBL/RBL·RBI, 당사 SWS 카탈로그)과 <strong>L볼</strong>(LHSA·LHS·PRC, 당사 IKO 카탈로그) — 을 용도가 같아 한 페이지에서 함께 비교할 수 있도록 모았습니다.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Link Ball · L-Ball</p> <h2>リンクボール・Lボール</h2> <p>ボールスタッドとソケット形シートが結合した球面ジョイントで、直線・揺動運動が同時に発生するリンク機構の連結部に使用されます。メーカー・型番体系が異なる2つのシリーズ ― <strong>リンクボール</strong>(ZBL/RBL・RBI、当社SWSカタログ)と<strong>Lボール</strong>(LHSA・LHS・PRC、当社IKOカタログ) ― を、用途が同じであるため1ページでまとめて比較できるようにしました。</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">型番または寸法の一部だけ入力しても検索できます。</p>","<button type=\"button\" class=\"cat-tab-btn active\" data-tab=\"link\">링크 볼 (ZBL/RBL·RBI)</button> <button type=\"button\" class=\"cat-tab-btn\" data-tab=\"lball\">L볼</button>":"<button type=\"button\" class=\"cat-tab-btn active\" data-tab=\"link\">リンクボール (ZBL/RBL・RBI)</button> <button type=\"button\" class=\"cat-tab-btn\" data-tab=\"lball\">Lボール</button>","ZBL(RBL) 시리즈":"ZBL(RBL)シリーズ","국내 유통 시장에서는 ZBL(잘만정공/JMC)과 RBL(일성테크/IBC) 두 형번이 동일 규격으로 상호 호환됩니다.":"国内流通市場では、ZBL(ジャルマン精工/JMC)とRBL(イルソンテック/IBC)の2つの型番が同一規格で相互互換します。","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">구조 단면도 (개념도)</p> <svg viewbox=\"0 0 360 220\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 320px; width: 100%; height: auto;\" aria-label=\"링크 볼 단면도\"> <path d=\"M110,30 h140 a30,30 0 0 1 30,30 v40 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 v-40 a30,30 0 0 1 10,-30 z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"></path> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"42\" fill=\"#e7e7e4\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#333\"></circle> <rect x=\"168\" y=\"142\" width=\"24\" height=\"52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"158\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"166\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"166\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"174\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"182\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"182\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,4,2,4\"></line> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"30\"></line><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"150\"></line> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"150\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"></line> </g> <text x=\"30\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\" transform=\"rotate(-90 30 94)\">L (전장)</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"25\"></line><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"25\"></line> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"20\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"></line> </g> <text x=\"180\" y=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">D (하우징 외경)</text> <text x=\"220\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">나사부</text> <defs> <marker id=\"lbArrow\" markerwidth=\"6\" markerheight=\"6\" refx=\"3\" refy=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"></path> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 볼 스터드 + 소켓 하우징 구조 · D(하우징 외경)·L(전장)·볼 지름·나사(Thread)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">실제 형번별 비례와는 다를 수 있는 구조 개념도이며, 치수값은 아래 표를 따릅니다.</span></p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">構造断面図(概念図)</p> <svg viewbox=\"0 0 360 220\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 320px; width: 100%; height: auto;\" aria-label=\"リンクボール断面図\"> <path d=\"M110,30 h140 a30,30 0 0 1 30,30 v40 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 v-40 a30,30 0 0 1 10,-30 z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"></path> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"42\" fill=\"#e7e7e4\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#333\"></circle> <rect x=\"168\" y=\"142\" width=\"24\" height=\"52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"158\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"166\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"166\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"174\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"182\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"182\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,4,2,4\"></line> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"30\"></line><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"150\"></line> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"150\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"></line> </g> <text x=\"30\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\" transform=\"rotate(-90 30 94)\">L (全長)</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"25\"></line><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"25\"></line> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"20\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"></line> </g> <text x=\"180\" y=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">D (ハウジング外径)</text> <text x=\"220\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">ねじ部</text> <defs> <marker id=\"lbArrow\" markerwidth=\"6\" markerheight=\"6\" refx=\"3\" refy=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"></path> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ ボールスタッド+ソケットハウジング構造 ・ D(ハウジング外径)・L(全長)・ボール径・ねじ(Thread)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">実際の型番ごとの比率とは異なる場合がある構造概念図であり、寸法値は下記の表に従います。</span></p>","<label for=\"lbFilter\">형번 검색</label> <input id=\"lbFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: ZBL10 또는 M12\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"lbFilter\">型番検索</label> <input id=\"lbFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"例: ZBL10 または M12\" autocomplete=\"off\">","나사(Thread)":"ねじ(Thread)","D(하우징 외경)":"D(ハウジング外径)","볼 지름":"ボール径","단위: mm (중량은 g)":"単位: mm (質量はg)","RBI 시리즈":"RBIシリーズ","ZBL(RBL)과 달리 양쪽 모두 축 방향으로 나사가 나오는 구조로, 당사 SWS 카탈로그에는 “수주 대응품”(주문 제작)으로 별도 수록되어 있습니다.":"ZBL(RBL)と異なり、両側とも軸方向にねじが突き出る構造で、当社SWSカタログには「受注対応品」(受注生産)として別途掲載されています。","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">당사 SWS 카탈로그 규격 도면</p> <img src=\"img/rbi_link_ball.png\" alt=\"RBI 구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">S·S1=나사 · L=전장 · D=하우징 외경 · W=폭</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">当社SWSカタログ規格図面</p> <img src=\"img/rbi_link_ball.png\" alt=\"RBI構造断面図\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">S・S1=ねじ ・ L=全長 ・ D=ハウジング外径 ・ W=幅</p>","<label for=\"rbiFilter\">형번 검색</label> <input id=\"rbiFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: RBI10 또는 M12\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"rbiFilter\">型番検索</label> <input id=\"rbiFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"例: RBI10 または M12\" autocomplete=\"off\">","※ ZBL(RBL) 규격은 당사 SWS 카탈로그의 로드 엔드 페이지에 “ZBL(RBL)”로 함께 수록되어 있으며, 국내 유통 자료(잘만정밀 등)와도 동일 규격입니다. “R/L”은 나사 방향(우·좌)을 나타내며 형번 끝에 별도 표기됩니다. RBI 규격 역시 같은 카탈로그 페이지에 “수주 대응품”으로 함께 수록되어 있으나, 주문 제작 품목인 만큼 리드타임·최소 수량은 발주 전 견적 문의로 확인하시기 바랍니다. 일부 유통 자료에서 유사 형번을 다른 제조사(예: THK) 제품으로 표기하는 경우가 있으니, 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 형번과 도면을 대조해 최종 확인하시기 바랍니다.":"※ ZBL(RBL)規格は当社SWSカタログのロッドエンドページに「ZBL(RBL)」として併記されており、国内流通資料(ジャルマン精密など)とも同一規格です。「R/L」はねじ方向(右・左)を示し、型番末尾に別途表記されます。RBI規格も同じカタログページに「受注対応品」として併記されていますが、受注生産品のためリードタイム・最小数量は発注前にお見積り依頼でご確認ください。一部の流通資料では類似の型番を他メーカー(例: THK)の製品として表記している場合がありますので、精密加工・発注前には必ず型番と図面を照合して最終確認してください。","볼 스터드와 교차되는 축심을 가진 자동 조심형 미끄럼 베어링입니다. 그리스 봉입형(LHSA), 무급유식(LHS), 그리고 LHS용 더스트 커버(PRC)로 구성됩니다. 자동차·건설기계·농업용 기계 등의 링크 기구에 사용됩니다.":"ボールスタッドと交差する軸心を持つ自動調心形すべり軸受です。グリース封入形(LHSA)、無給油式(LHS)、およびLHS用ダストカバー(PRC)で構成されます。自動車・建設機械・農業用機械などのリンク機構に使用されます。","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">당사 IKO 카탈로그 규격 도면 · L볼의 구조</p> <img src=\"img/l_ball_structure.png\" alt=\"L볼 LHSA·LHS 구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; width: 100%; max-width: 950px; height: auto; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">볼 스터드 · 본체 · 부시(저탄소강 또는 동합금) · 더스트 커버(LHSA 5 이상)</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">当社IKOカタログ規格図面・Lボールの構造</p> <img src=\"img/l_ball_structure.png\" alt=\"LボールLHSA・LHS構造断面図\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; width: 100%; max-width: 950px; height: auto; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">ボールスタッド ・ 本体 ・ ブッシュ(低炭素鋼または銅合金) ・ ダストカバー(LHSA 5以上)</p>","<label for=\"lballFilter\">형번 / 규격 검색</label> <input id=\"lballFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: LHSA10 또는 LHS20\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"lballFilter\">型番／規格検索</label> <input id=\"lballFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"例: LHSA10 または LHS20\" autocomplete=\"off\">","<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"lballCount\" style=\"margin:0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"lballToggleAll\">전체 펼치기</button>":"<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"lballCount\" style=\"margin:0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"lballToggleAll\">すべて展開</button>","LHSA 시리즈 · 리튬계면활성그리스 봉입형<span class=\"series-count\">8건</span>":"LHSAシリーズ・リチウム界面活性グリース封入形<span class=\"series-count\">8件</span>","나사 S":"ねじ S","볼직경 mm":"ボール径 mm","LHS 시리즈 · 무급유식(자체 윤활이 필요)<span class=\"series-count\">10건</span>":"LHSシリーズ・無給油式(自己潤滑が必要)<span class=\"series-count\">10件</span>","PRC · L볼용 더스트 커버(LHS용)<span class=\"series-count\">10건</span>":"PRC・Lボール用ダストカバー(LHS用)<span class=\"series-count\">10件</span>"},"zh":{"링크 볼·필로볼·L볼 | [회사명] 베어링":"连杆球头·枢轴球·L型球头 | [公司名] 轴承","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Link Ball · L-Ball</p> <h2>링크 볼·L볼</h2> <p>볼 스터드와 소켓형 시트가 결합된 구면 조인트로, 직선·요동 운동이 함께 발생하는 링크 기구의 연결부에 사용됩니다. 제조사·형번 체계가 서로 다른 두 계열 — <strong>링크 볼</strong>(ZBL/RBL·RBI, 당사 SWS 카탈로그)과 <strong>L볼</strong>(LHSA·LHS·PRC, 당사 IKO 카탈로그) — 을 용도가 같아 한 페이지에서 함께 비교할 수 있도록 모았습니다.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Link Ball · L-Ball</p> <h2>连杆球头·L型球头</h2> <p>由球头销与球座型座体结合而成的球面接头，用于同时存在直线运动和摆动运动的连杆机构连接部位。制造商、型号体系互不相同的两个系列 —— <strong>连杆球头</strong>(ZBL/RBL·RBI，本公司SWS产品目录)与<strong>L型球头</strong>(LHSA·LHS·PRC，本公司IKO产品目录) —— 由于用途相同，汇总在同一页面以便对比查看。</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">仅输入型号或尺寸的一部分也可以搜索。</p>","<button type=\"button\" class=\"cat-tab-btn active\" data-tab=\"link\">링크 볼 (ZBL/RBL·RBI)</button> <button type=\"button\" class=\"cat-tab-btn\" data-tab=\"lball\">L볼</button>":"<button type=\"button\" class=\"cat-tab-btn active\" data-tab=\"link\">连杆球头 (ZBL/RBL·RBI)</button> <button type=\"button\" class=\"cat-tab-btn\" data-tab=\"lball\">L型球头</button>","ZBL(RBL) 시리즈":"ZBL(RBL)系列","국내 유통 시장에서는 ZBL(잘만정공/JMC)과 RBL(일성테크/IBC) 두 형번이 동일 규격으로 상호 호환됩니다.":"在国内流通市场，ZBL(Jalman精工/JMC)与RBL(日成科技/IBC)两种型号在相同规格下可相互替换使用。","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">구조 단면도 (개념도)</p> <svg viewbox=\"0 0 360 220\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 320px; width: 100%; height: auto;\" aria-label=\"링크 볼 단면도\"> <path d=\"M110,30 h140 a30,30 0 0 1 30,30 v40 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 v-40 a30,30 0 0 1 10,-30 z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"></path> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"42\" fill=\"#e7e7e4\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#333\"></circle> <rect x=\"168\" y=\"142\" width=\"24\" height=\"52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"158\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"166\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"166\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"174\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"182\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"182\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,4,2,4\"></line> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"30\"></line><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"150\"></line> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"150\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"></line> </g> <text x=\"30\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\" transform=\"rotate(-90 30 94)\">L (전장)</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"25\"></line><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"25\"></line> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"20\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"></line> </g> <text x=\"180\" y=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">D (하우징 외경)</text> <text x=\"220\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">나사부</text> <defs> <marker id=\"lbArrow\" markerwidth=\"6\" markerheight=\"6\" refx=\"3\" refy=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"></path> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 볼 스터드 + 소켓 하우징 구조 · D(하우징 외경)·L(전장)·볼 지름·나사(Thread)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">실제 형번별 비례와는 다를 수 있는 구조 개념도이며, 치수값은 아래 표를 따릅니다.</span></p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">结构剖面图(概念图)</p> <svg viewbox=\"0 0 360 220\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 320px; width: 100%; height: auto;\" aria-label=\"连杆球头剖面图\"> <path d=\"M110,30 h140 a30,30 0 0 1 30,30 v40 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 v-40 a30,30 0 0 1 10,-30 z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"></path> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"42\" fill=\"#e7e7e4\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#333\"></circle> <rect x=\"168\" y=\"142\" width=\"24\" height=\"52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"158\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"166\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"166\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"174\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"182\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"182\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,4,2,4\"></line> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"30\"></line><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"150\"></line> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"150\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"></line> </g> <text x=\"30\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\" transform=\"rotate(-90 30 94)\">L (全长)</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"25\"></line><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"25\"></line> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"20\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"></line> </g> <text x=\"180\" y=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">D (壳体外径)</text> <text x=\"220\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">螺纹部</text> <defs> <marker id=\"lbArrow\" markerwidth=\"6\" markerheight=\"6\" refx=\"3\" refy=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"></path> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 球头销+球座壳体结构 · D(壳体外径)·L(全长)·球径·螺纹(Thread)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">本图为结构概念图，实际各型号比例可能有所不同，具体尺寸请以下表为准。</span></p>","<label for=\"lbFilter\">형번 검색</label> <input id=\"lbFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: ZBL10 또는 M12\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"lbFilter\">型号搜索</label> <input id=\"lbFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"例: ZBL10 或 M12\" autocomplete=\"off\">","나사(Thread)":"螺纹(Thread)","D(하우징 외경)":"D(壳体外径)","볼 지름":"球径","단위: mm (중량은 g)":"单位: mm (重量为g)","RBI 시리즈":"RBI系列","ZBL(RBL)과 달리 양쪽 모두 축 방향으로 나사가 나오는 구조로, 당사 SWS 카탈로그에는 “수주 대응품”(주문 제작)으로 별도 수록되어 있습니다.":"与ZBL(RBL)不同，该结构两端均沿轴向伸出螺纹，在本公司SWS产品目录中作为“按单生产品”(定制生产)单独收录。","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">당사 SWS 카탈로그 규격 도면</p> <img src=\"img/rbi_link_ball.png\" alt=\"RBI 구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">S·S1=나사 · L=전장 · D=하우징 외경 · W=폭</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">本公司SWS产品目录规格图纸</p> <img src=\"img/rbi_link_ball.png\" alt=\"RBI结构剖面图\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">S·S1=螺纹 · L=全长 · D=壳体外径 · W=宽度</p>","<label for=\"rbiFilter\">형번 검색</label> <input id=\"rbiFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: RBI10 또는 M12\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"rbiFilter\">型号搜索</label> <input id=\"rbiFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"例: RBI10 或 M12\" autocomplete=\"off\">","※ ZBL(RBL) 규격은 당사 SWS 카탈로그의 로드 엔드 페이지에 “ZBL(RBL)”로 함께 수록되어 있으며, 국내 유통 자료(잘만정밀 등)와도 동일 규격입니다. “R/L”은 나사 방향(우·좌)을 나타내며 형번 끝에 별도 표기됩니다. RBI 규격 역시 같은 카탈로그 페이지에 “수주 대응품”으로 함께 수록되어 있으나, 주문 제작 품목인 만큼 리드타임·최소 수량은 발주 전 견적 문의로 확인하시기 바랍니다. 일부 유통 자료에서 유사 형번을 다른 제조사(예: THK) 제품으로 표기하는 경우가 있으니, 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 형번과 도면을 대조해 최종 확인하시기 바랍니다.":"※ ZBL(RBL)规格与“ZBL(RBL)”一同收录于本公司SWS产品目录的杆端关节轴承页面，与国内流通资料(Jalman精密等)规格相同。“R/L”表示螺纹方向(右·左)，在型号末尾单独标注。RBI规格同样在同一产品目录页面中作为“按单生产品”收录，但由于是定制生产项目，下单前请通过询价确认交货期·最小订购量。部分流通资料将类似型号标注为其他制造商(如THK)的产品，因此精密加工·下单前，请务必核对型号与图纸做最终确认。","볼 스터드와 교차되는 축심을 가진 자동 조심형 미끄럼 베어링입니다. 그리스 봉입형(LHSA), 무급유식(LHS), 그리고 LHS용 더스트 커버(PRC)로 구성됩니다. 자동차·건설기계·농업용 기계 등의 링크 기구에 사용됩니다.":"具有与球头销交叉轴心的调心滑动轴承。由加脂密封型(LHSA)、免加油型(LHS)以及LHS用防尘罩(PRC)组成。用于汽车、工程机械、农业机械等的连杆机构。","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">당사 IKO 카탈로그 규격 도면 · L볼의 구조</p> <img src=\"img/l_ball_structure.png\" alt=\"L볼 LHSA·LHS 구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; width: 100%; max-width: 950px; height: auto; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">볼 스터드 · 본체 · 부시(저탄소강 또는 동합금) · 더스트 커버(LHSA 5 이상)</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">本公司IKO产品目录规格图纸·L型球头结构</p> <img src=\"img/l_ball_structure.png\" alt=\"L型球头LHSA·LHS结构剖面图\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; width: 100%; max-width: 950px; height: auto; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">球头销 · 本体 · 衬套(低碳钢或铜合金) · 防尘罩(LHSA 5及以上)</p>","<label for=\"lballFilter\">형번 / 규격 검색</label> <input id=\"lballFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: LHSA10 또는 LHS20\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"lballFilter\">型号/规格搜索</label> <input id=\"lballFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"例: LHSA10 或 LHS20\" autocomplete=\"off\">","<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"lballCount\" style=\"margin:0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"lballToggleAll\">전체 펼치기</button>":"<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"lballCount\" style=\"margin:0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"lballToggleAll\">全部展开</button>","LHSA 시리즈 · 리튬계면활성그리스 봉입형<span class=\"series-count\">8건</span>":"LHSA系列·锂基表面活性剂润滑脂封装型<span class=\"series-count\">8项</span>","나사 S":"螺纹 S","볼직경 mm":"球径 mm","LHS 시리즈 · 무급유식(자체 윤활이 필요)<span class=\"series-count\">10건</span>":"LHS系列·免加油型(需自润滑)<span class=\"series-count\">10项</span>","PRC · L볼용 더스트 커버(LHS용)<span class=\"series-count\">10건</span>":"PRC·L型球头用防尘罩(LHS用)<span class=\"series-count\">10项</span>"}},"attrs":{"en":{"링크 볼 단면도":"Link Ball Cross-Section Diagram","예: ZBL10 또는 M12":"e.g. ZBL10 or M12","RBI 구조 단면도":"RBI Structure Cross-Section Diagram","예: RBI10 또는 M12":"e.g. RBI10 or M12","L볼 LHSA·LHS 구조 단면도":"L-Ball LHSA/LHS Structure Cross-Section Diagram","예: LHSA10 또는 LHS20":"e.g. LHSA10 or LHS20"},"ja":{"링크 볼 단면도":"リンクボール断面図","예: ZBL10 또는 M12":"例: ZBL10 または M12","RBI 구조 단면도":"RBI構造断面図","예: RBI10 또는 M12":"例: RBI10 または M12","L볼 LHSA·LHS 구조 단면도":"LボールLHSA・LHS構造断面図","예: LHSA10 또는 LHS20":"例: LHSA10 または LHS20"},"zh":{"링크 볼 단면도":"连杆球头剖面图","예: ZBL10 또는 M12":"例: ZBL10 或 M12","RBI 구조 단면도":"RBI结构剖面图","예: RBI10 또는 M12":"例: RBI10 或 M12","L볼 LHSA·LHS 구조 단면도":"L型球头LHSA·LHS结构剖面图","예: LHSA10 또는 LHS20":"例: LHSA10 或 LHS20"}}}